WEBVTT

NOTE Unpublished storyboard only. No hosted video or native <video> player is supplied in R477. Each cue is original text.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two people watch the same fictional crash.
Different questions follow.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
One hears "contacted."
Another hears "smashed."

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A 1974 experiment found shifts in reports,
including about glass that was never shown.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
This is a result about eyewitness reports,
not proof that every memory is wrong.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Ask of any seller's claim:
What was actually tested?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Choose an audio format for its features.
Don't buy a promise to rewire your mind.
